KR if '₨' isn't explicitly handled. Analyzing how `PKR` renders across various components such as `BillsRent.jsx`, `Expenses.jsx`, and others.\n\n**Developing PKR Currency Display Logic**\n\nA utility function will be created to ensure `PKR` amounts are displayed with '₨'. The function will need to determine the optimal way to include the currency symbol, whether before or after the amount, ensuring consistency. Further evaluation of the existing currency display implementation will ensure all components use this utility.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"$env:PATH = \"C:\\Program Files\\nodejs;\" + $env:PATH; & \"C:\\Program Files\\nodejs\\node.exe\" -e \"const db = require('./server/db/database'); const users = db.prepare('SELECT id, name, email, currency FROM users').all(); console.log('USERS:', users);\"","Cwd":"C:\\Users\\HP\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\household-app","WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Checking existing database users and currency","toolSummary":"Inspect users table in SQLite"}}]}
